  "prefLabel": "Liq 202.01 Interpretation of Statutes/Administrative Rules",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 202.01 Interpretation of Statutes/Administrative Rules. Any question relating to the specific applicability of RSA 175 through RSA 180, RSA 126-K relating to the commission, administrative rules adopted by the commission, or a commission order shall be submitted in writing as a petition to the commission requesting a declaratory ruling.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Liq 200) #13992, eff 5-31-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/liq100-1100.html"
